    &gt;espressif/esp-idf&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;espressif-iot-development-framework&#34;&gt;Espressif IoT Development Framework
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./README_CN.md&#34; &gt;中文版&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ESP-IDF is the development framework for Espressif SoCs supported on Windows, Linux and macOS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;esp-idf-release-support-schedule&#34;&gt;ESP-IDF Release Support Schedule
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dl.espressif.com/dl/esp-idf/support-periods.svg?v=1&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Support Schedule&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please read &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;SUPPORT_POLICY.md&#34; &gt;the support policy&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/latest/esp32/versions.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the documentation&lt;/a&gt; for more information about ESP-IDF versions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please see the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.espressif.com/en/support/documents/advisories?keys=&amp;amp;field_type_of_advisory_tid%5B%5D=817&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;End-of-Life Advisories&lt;/a&gt; for information about ESP-IDF releases with discontinued support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
